of those two chosen drinks.

00:09:14.419 --> 00:09:16.255
-Okay. Thank you, Drinko.
-You're welcome.

00:09:16.255 --> 00:09:18.290
-I wonder who that is.
-I appreciate it, Drinko.

00:09:18.357 --> 00:09:20.593
-I wonder who that is.
-Well, that's the robot, Drinko.

00:09:20.593 --> 00:09:23.129
-Yeah, I know.
-Alright.

00:09:23.129 --> 00:09:25.798
